{"title":"Career roadmap · Behavioural Trainer","role":"Behavioural Trainer","summary":"A Behavioural Trainer helps individuals or groups develop professional, interpersonal, communication, leadership, emotional-regulation, teamwork, or workplace behaviours. A psychology background is useful for understanding motivation, learning, behaviour change, communication, and group dynamics.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 of UG","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Applied Psychology / Counselling / Neuropsychology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Behavioural Trainer helps individuals or groups develop professional, interpersonal, communication, leadership, emotional-regulation, teamwork, or workplace behaviours. A psychology background is useful for understanding motivation, learning, behaviour change, communication, and group dynamics."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong alignment with Applied Psychology. For corporate behavioural training, the BA can provide the foundation, while practical facilitation experience and postgraduate study/certifications can strengthen employability."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Psychology","Psychology/Training Internship","Training/L&D Intern or Assistant","Behavioural Trainer","Senior Behavioural Trainer","L&D/Behavioural Training Specialist","Training Manager / Behavioural Learning Lead","L&D Head / Independent Consultant"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build psychology fundamentals, communication, facilitation and training experience"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in behavioural training, L&D, organisational psychology or coaching"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Lead programmes, design behavioural interventions and manage corporate training portfolios"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Become an L&D/behavioural consultant, training leader, specialist coach or independent practice lead"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Psychology fundamentals"},{"text":"Introductory psychology + observation"},{"text":"Behaviour observation report"},{"text":"Psychological foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Communication & interpersonal skills"},{"text":"Communication, social psychology"},{"text":"3–5 recorded presentations"},{"text":"Communication"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Learning & behaviour"},{"text":"Behavioural psychology, learning theory"},{"text":"Behaviour-change case study"},{"text":"Behavioural analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Facilitation"},{"text":"Workshops, group dynamics"},{"text":"Conduct a student workshop"},{"text":"Facilitation"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Training design"},{"text":"Instructional design, adult learning"},{"text":"Complete training module"},{"text":"Training capability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Internship + portfolio"},{"text":"L&D/NGO/education organisation"},{"text":"Internship + trainer portfolio"},{"text":"Employability"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Organisational psychology / counselling / behavioural science"},{"text":"Specialised intervention project"},{"text":"Domain depth"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Professional launch"},{"text":"L&D + assessment + presentation"},{"text":"Capstone + training demo + CV"},{"text":"Job readiness"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects to prioritise"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"General Psychology"},{"text":"Developmental Psychology"},{"text":"Social Psychology"},{"text":"Cognitive Psychology"},{"text":"Behavioural Psychology"},{"text":"Learning Psychology"},{"text":"Personality Psychology"},{"text":"Counselling Psychology"},{"text":"Applied Psychology"},{"text":"Organisational Psychology"},{"text":"Industrial Psychology"},{"text":"Psychological Assessment"},{"text":"Research Methodology"},{"text":"Statistics for Psychology"},{"text":"Health Psychology"},{"text":"Neuropsychology"},{"text":"Group Dynamics"},{"text":"Communication Psychology"},{"text":"Motivation"},{"text":"Emotional Intelligence"},{"text":"Positive Psychology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical and professional skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Behaviour observation"},{"text":"Basic psychological assessment"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Facilitation"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Public speaking"},{"text":"Group discussion management"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"},{"text":"Emotional-intelligence training"},{"text":"Behaviour-change techniques"},{"text":"Adult learning principles"},{"text":"Instructional design"},{"text":"Training-needs analysis"},{"text":"Training evaluation"},{"text":"Feedback techniques"},{"text":"Role-play and simulation"},{"text":"Case-study development"},{"text":"Survey design"},{"text":"Excel / Google Sheets"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Basic data analysis"},{"text":"LMS platforms"},{"text":"Online workshop tools"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important boundary","text":"A behavioural trainer should not represent themselves as a clinical psychologist, diagnose mental disorders, or provide regulated clinical treatment unless they possess the qualifications and registration legally required for that activity."},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio target"},{"type":"h","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Behavioural observation report"},{"text":"Personality/behaviour case study"},{"text":"Communication-skills workshop"},{"text":"Emotional-intelligence workshop"},{"text":"Leadership workshop"},{"text":"Team-building activity"},{"text":"Conflict-resolution simulation"},{"text":"Behaviour-change intervention"},{"text":"Training-needs analysis"},{"text":"Complete 60–90 minute training module"},{"text":"Facilitator guide"},{"text":"Participant workbook"},{"text":"Pre/post training assessment"},{"text":"Training feedback dashboard"},{"text":"Psychology research project"},{"text":"Internship report"},{"text":"Recorded trainer demonstration"},{"text":"Final behavioural-training capstone"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Corporate Behavioural Training"},{"text":"Communication, leadership, workplace behaviour"},{"text":"Organisational psychology + L&D"},{"text":"Behavioural Training Lead"}],[{"text":"Emotional Intelligence"},{"text":"EQ, self-awareness, relationships"},{"text":"Psychology + coaching"},{"text":"EQ Training Specialist"}],[{"text":"Leadership Development"},{"text":"Leadership, motivation, decision-making"},{"text":"Organisational psychology"},{"text":"Leadership Development Specialist"}],[{"text":"Communication Training"},{"text":"Presentation, listening, interpersonal skills"},{"text":"Communication psychology"},{"text":"Communication Trainer"}],[{"text":"Team Development"},{"text":"Group dynamics, conflict, collaboration"},{"text":"Social/organisational psychology"},{"text":"Team Development Consultant"}],[{"text":"Student Development"},{"text":"Study skills, confidence, career behaviour"},{"text":"Educational psychology"},{"text":"Student Development Lead"}],[{"text":"Employee Wellness"},{"text":"Stress management, resilience, wellbeing"},{"text":"Health/positive psychology"},{"text":"Workplace Wellbeing Specialist"}],[{"text":"Behavioural Science"},{"text":"Behavioural economics, experimentation, decision science"},{"text":"Behavioural science + research"},{"text":"Behavioural Scientist"}],[{"text":"Coaching"},{"text":"Goal setting, feedback, acco