ment firms"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Best internship evidence","text":"don't just collect a certificate. Keep evidence of training modules designed, workshops delivered, participants reached, feedback scores and measurable pre/post learning outcomes."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / course","Cost","When","Why it helps"],"rows":[[{"text":"Psychology / Behavioural Science course"},{"text":"Free/paid depending on provider"},{"text":"Year 1–2"},{"text":"Builds foundation"}],[{"text":"NPTEL Psychology / behavioural courses"},{"text":"Course access generally free; certificate exam fee: check the official site"},{"text":"Year 1–3"},{"text":"Academic depth"}],[{"text":"Instructional Design"},{"text":"Paid/free options"},{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Training design"}],[{"text":"Train-the-Trainer"},{"text":"Paid; fee: check the official site"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Direct trainer capability"}],[{"text":"Learning & Development"},{"text":"Paid; fee: check the official site"},{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"Corporate L&D"}],[{"text":"Coaching fundamentals"},{"text":"Paid; provider-specific"},{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"Coaching skills"}],[{"text":"Emotional Intelligence"},{"text":"Paid/free options"},{"text":"Year 2–4"},{"text":"Behavioural training"}],[{"text":"Data Analysis / Excel"},{"text":"Free/paid"},{"text":"Year 1–3"},{"text":"Training evaluation"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Free learning; certification fee: check the official site"},{"text":"Year 2–4"},{"text":"Training dashboards"}],[{"text":"Presentation / Facilitation"},{"text":"Free/paid"},{"text":"Year 1–4"},{"text":"Trainer effectiveness"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Paid/free options"},{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"Programme execution"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For learning resources, NPTEL is a useful starting point."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"F